{"canonicalKey":"ethics.pass_the_gift_forward","contentHash":"bf8e2cea81741013ec88ccc52b9e3f702adf40f2056b4d29f0141e9a0f80814f","contentType":"original_synthesis","formalTheoryChunk":false,"schemaVersion":"xinzhili.chunk-preview.v1","sourceKind":"card","status":"draft","text":"天赋和所得需要负责任地传递。传递所得应以真实能力、知情同意和可承担边界为前提，而不是用使命叙事要求自己或他人。"}
